# SC-01: 从 GitHub 导入 Skill
# 流程图: import-from-github.mermaid

flowchart TD
    Start([开始: 用户点击安装按钮]) --> ValidateInput{验证输入}
    ValidateInput -->|URL 无效| ShowURLError[显示错误<br/>请输入有效的 GitHub URL]
    ValidateInput -->|URL 有效| CreateTask[创建后台任务]
    ShowURLError --> End([结束])

    CreateTask --> GenerateTaskID[生成任务 ID]
    GenerateTaskID --> SaveTaskDB[保存任务到数据库<br/>status: pending]

    SaveTaskDB --> EmitCreated[发送任务创建事件]
    EmitCreated --> UpdateStatusRunning[更新任务状态为 running]

    UpdateStatusRunning --> Step1_Download[步骤 1: 下载 Skill 文件]
    Step1_Download --> CallGitHubAPI[调用 GitHub API]
    CallGitHubAPI --> GetRepoInfo[获取仓库信息]
    GetRepoInfo --> DownloadFiles[下载 SKILL.md 和相关文件]
    DownloadFiles --> EmitProgress20[发送进度事件 20%<br/>正在下载...]

    EmitProgress20 --> Step2_Parse[步骤 2: 解析 SKILL.md]
    Step2_Parse --> ReadFile[读取 SKILL.md 文件]
    ReadFile --> ExtractFrontmatter[提取 frontmatter<br/>YAML 格式]
    ExtractFrontmatter --> ParseFields[解析字段<br/>name, description, version, author]
    ParseFields --> ValidateMetadata{验证元数据}
    ValidateMetadata -->|失败| UseDefaults[使用默认值<br/>version: 1.0.0]
    ValidateMetadata -->|成功| CheckFrontmatter
    UseDefaults --> CheckFrontmatter{frontmatter 存在?}
    CheckFrontmatter -->|否| ShowManifestError[显示错误<br/>仓库中未发现 SKILL.md]
    CheckFrontmatter -->|是| EmitProgress40
    ShowManifestError --> UpdateStatusFailed[更新任务状态为 failed]
    UpdateStatusFailed --> EmitFailed[发送任务失败事件]
    EmitFailed --> End

    EmitProgress40[发送进度事件 40%<br/>正在解析...] --> Step3_Security[步骤 3: 安全扫描]
    Step3_Security --> CallSecurityScan[调用 scan_skill_security]
    CallSecurityScan --> CalcChecksum[计算 SHA-256 校验和]
    CalcChecksum --> CheckCache{检查缓存}
    CheckCache -->|缓存命中| ReturnCache[返回缓存结果]
    CheckCache -->|缓存未命中| ExecuteRules[执行安全规则检测]

    ExecuteRules --> FindFindings[查找风险发现]
    FindFindings --> CheckWhitelist{检查白名单}
    CheckWhitelist --> FilterFindings[过滤白名单规则]
    FilterFindings --> CalcScore[计算安全评分<br/>100 - total_penalty]
    CalcScore --> DetermineLevel{确定安全等级}
    DetermineLevel -->|>=90| SetSafe[设置等级: safe]
    DetermineLevel -->|70-89| SetRisk[设置等级: risk]
    DetermineLevel -->|<70| SetBlocked[设置等级: blocked]

    SetSafe --> SaveReport[保存安全报告]
    SetRisk --> CheckBlock{是否阻断?}
    SetBlocked --> CheckBlock

    SaveReport --> EmitProgress60
    CheckBlock -->|是| UpdateStatusBlocked[更新状态为 blocked]
    CheckBlock -->|否| EmitProgress60
    UpdateStatusBlocked --> EmitBlocked[发送阻断事件]
    EmitBlocked --> End

    EmitProgress60[发送进度事件 60%<br/>正在扫描...] --> Step4_Quality[步骤 4: 质量评分]
    Step4_Quality --> CallQualityScan[调用 analyze_skill_quality]
    CallQualityScan --> ScoreContent[评分内容质量<br/>50分]
    ScoreContent --> ScoreTechnical[评分技术实现<br/>30分]
    ScoreTechnical --> ScoreMaintenance[评分维护性<br/>10分]
    ScoreMaintenance --> ScoreUX[评分用户体验<br/>10分]

    ScoreUX --> SumScores[汇总评分]
    SumScores --> CalcTotal[计算总分<br/>0-100]
    CalcTotal --> DetermineGrade{确定等级}
    DetermineGrade -->|90-100| GradeS[S 级: 卓越]
    DetermineGrade -->|80-89| GradeA[A 级: 优秀]
    DetermineGrade -->|70-79| GradeB[B 级: 良好]
    DetermineGrade -->|60-69| GradeC[C 级: 合格]
    DetermineGrade -->|0-59| GradeD[D 级: 需改进]

    GradeS --> SaveQualityReport[保存质量报告]
    GradeA --> SaveQualityReport
    GradeB --> SaveQualityReport
    GradeC --> SaveQualityReport
    GradeD --> SaveQualityReport

    SaveQualityReport --> EmitProgress80[发送进度事件 80%<br/>正在评分...]

    EmitProgress80 --> Step5_Install[步骤 5: 安装到本地]
    Step5_Install --> ChooseTarget{选择目标目录}
    ChooseTarget -->|系统级| SystemDir[~/.claude/skills/]
    ChooseTarget -->|项目级| ProjectDir[/project/.claude/skills/]

    SystemDir --> CopyFiles[复制 Skill 文件]
    ProjectDir --> CopyFiles

    CopyFiles --> SaveToDB[保存到数据库<br/>installed_skills 表]
    SaveToDB --> UpdateInstalled[更新 marketplace_skills<br/>installed: true]
    UpdateInstalled --> EmitProgress100[发送进度事件 100%]

    EmitProgress100 --> UpdateStatusCompleted[更新任务状态为 completed]
    UpdateStatusCompleted --> EmitCompleted[发送任务完成事件]
    EmitCompleted --> ShowToast[显示 Toast 提示<br/>✅ 安装成功]
    ShowToast --> RefreshList[刷新 我的 Skills 列表]
    RefreshList --> End([结束: 导入完成])

    ReturnCache --> EmitProgress60

    style Start fill:#e1f5e1
    style End fill:#e1f5e1
    style ShowURLError fill:#f8d7da
    style ShowManifestError fill:#f8d7da
    style ShowToast fill:#d1ecf1
    style UpdateStatusFailed fill:#f8d7da
    style UpdateStatusBlocked fill:#f8d7da
    style UpdateStatusCompleted fill:#d1ecf1
